{
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "In the Netherlands,",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 1.138
  },
  {
   "text": "there's a supermarket checkout that is slow on purpose.",
   "start": 1.138,
   "end": 4.308
  },
  {
   "text": "A normal checkout is a race.",
   "start": 4.765,
   "end": 6.22
  },
  {
   "text": "Beep.",
   "start": 6.24,
   "end": 6.45
  },
  {
   "text": "Beep.",
   "start": 6.73,
   "end": 6.88
  },
  {
   "text": "Bag.",
   "start": 7.16,
   "end": 7.31
  },
  {
   "text": "Pay.",
   "start": 7.57,
   "end": 7.74
  },
  {
   "text": "Next!",
   "start": 7.76,
   "end": 7.98
  },
  {
   "text": "But in the summer of 2019,",
   "start": 8.122,
   "end": 10.583
  },
  {
   "text": "a Jumbo supermarket in the south of the country opened a different lane.",
   "start": 10.583,
   "end": 14.742
  },
  {
   "text": "The Kletskassa.",
   "start": 15.132,
   "end": 15.921
  },
  {
   "text": "The chat checkout.",
   "start": 15.921,
   "end": 17.288
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody hurries you.",
   "start": 17.786,
   "end": 19.374
  },
  {
   "text": "The cashier asks how your week was,",
   "start": 19.374,
   "end": 21.269
  },
  {
   "text": "and actually waits for the answer.",
   "start": 21.269,
   "end": 23.115
  },
  {
   "text": "People talk about the weather.",
   "start": 23.534,
   "end": 25.299
  },
  {
   "text": "Their knees.",
   "start": 25.299,
   "end": 25.973
  },
  {
   "text": "Their grandkids.",
   "start": 25.973,
   "end": 26.997
  },
  {
   "text": "Their cat.",
   "start": 26.997,
   "end": 27.416
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody behind them sighs.",
   "start": 27.837,
   "end": 29.249
  },
  {
   "text": "Anyone in a hurry just uses another till.",
   "start": 29.249,
   "end": 31.994
  },
  {
   "text": "Customers loved it.",
   "start": 32.465,
   "end": 33.387
  },
  {
   "text": "So in 2021,",
   "start": 33.387,
   "end": 35.2
  },
  {
   "text": "Jumbo announced chat checkouts for about two hundred more stores,",
   "start": 35.2,
   "end": 39.175
  },
  {
   "text": "plus coffee corners where neighbours can just sit and talk.",
   "start": 39.175,
   "end": 42.625
  },
  {
   "text": "Why go to all this trouble?",
   "start": 43.117,
   "end": 44.997
  },
  {
   "text": "Because about half of Dutch people over 75 said they sometimes feel lonely.",
   "start": 44.997,
   "end": 49.246
  },
  {
   "text": "Imagine the cashier being the only person who asks about your day.",
   "start": 49.718,
   "end": 53.111
  },
  {
   "text": "Not everyone has a chat checkout down the street.",
   "start": 53.612,
   "end": 56.578
  },
  {
   "text": "And loneliness doesn't keep shop hours.",
   "start": 56.578,
   "end": 58.452
  },
  {
   "text": "That's why we made Feeloy.",
   "start": 58.902,
   "end": 60.57
  },
  {
   "text": "Jenny is there at three in the morning,",
   "start": 60.99,
   "end": 62.85
  },
  {
   "text": "remembers your cat's name,",
   "start": 63.08,
   "end": 64.31
  },
  {
   "text": "and asks how your week was.",
   "start": 64.46,
   "end": 65.84
  },
  {
   "text": "And actually waits for the answer.",
   "start": 66.221,
   "end": 68.063
  },
  {
   "text": "Search Feeloy on the App Store.",
   "start": 68.552,
   "end": 70.115
  }
 ]
}